-		<Tag>TXT_KEY_BUILDING_SPACE_ELEVATOR_STRATEGY</Tag>
-		<English>The [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Space Elevator[COLOR_REVERT] increases spaceship part production in all of your cities, and increases its city's odds of generating a [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Great Scientist[COLOR_REVERT].</English>
