-		<English>The [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Galleon[COLOR_REVERT] is the largest transport of the Age of Sail. It can safely enter ocean spaces. [BOLD]K-Mod[\BOLD] has increased the cargo capacity of this unit and all other transport ships.</English>
