-		<English>The [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Transport[COLOR_REVERT] is the cargo ship with the largest capacity. It can enter ocean spaces but is vulnerable to modern warships. [BOLD]K-Mod[\BOLD] has increased the cargo capacity of this unit and all earlier transport ships. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] reduces the production cost of this unit, but removes its ability to attack, pillage and blockade, and reduces its combat strength. Can no longer be built with Uranium because a cheap troop transport couldn't plausibly have a nuclear reactor.</English>
