-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>TXT_KEY_UNIT_TRIREME_STRATEGY</Tag>
-		<English>[COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Triremes[COLOR_REVERT] are especially effective in combat, but they have no transport capacity. They cannot enter ocean spaces. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD]: Now has +1 speed, cost slightly reduced and higher base strength, but no bonus specifically against Galley. This makes Trireme a more efficient warship than Caravel and Galleon, although still less mobile.</English>
