-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>TXT_KEY_UNIT_CARAVEL_STRATEGY</Tag>
-		<English>This small and fast ship can explore oceans and rival territory. [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Caravels[COLOR_REVERT] can transport special units - [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Scouts[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Explorers[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Spies[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Missionaries[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Executives[COLOR_REVERT] and [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Great People[COLOR_REVERT]. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD]: Speed increased by 1; as fast as [LINK=UNIT_GALLEON]Galleon[\LINK] now.</English>
-		<French>Ce petit navire rapide peut explorer les oc&#233;ans et territoires ennemis. Les [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]caravelles[COLOR_REVERT] peuvent transporter une unit&#233; sp&#233;ciale : [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]&#233;claireur[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]explorateur[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]missionnaire[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]espion[COLOR_REVERT] ou [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]personnage illustre[COLOR_REVERT].</French>
-		<German>Diese kleinen und schnellen Schiffe k&#246;nnen die Weltmeere und ferne L&#228;nder erforschen. [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Karavellen[COLOR_REVERT] transportieren die Spezialeinheiten ([COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Sp&#228;her[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Kundschafter[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Missionar[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Vorstand[COLOR_REVERT], [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Spion[COLOR_REVERT] und [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Gro&#223;e Pers&#246;nlichkeit[COLOR_REVERT]). [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD]: +1 Geschwindigkeit und damit ebenso schnell wie [LINK=UNIT_GALLEON]Galeone[\LINK].</German>
-		<Italian>Questa piccola e rapida nave pu&#242; esplorare gli oceani e i territori rivali. Le [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]caravelle[COLOR_REVERT] possono trasportare un'unit&#224; speciale: scout, esploratore, missionario, spia o Grande Personaggio.</Italian>
-		<Spanish>Esta nave, peque&#241;a y r&#225;pida, puede explorar oc&#233;anos y territorio enemigo. Las [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Carabelas[COLOR_REVERT] pueden transportar a una unidad especial: un [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Batidor[COLOR_REVERT], un [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Explorador[COLOR_REVERT], un [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Esp&#237;a[COLOR_REVERT], un [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Misionero[COLOR_REVERT] o un [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Gran personaje[COLOR_REVERT].</Spanish>
-	</TEXT>
-	<!-- advc.905b -->
-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>TXT_KEY_UNIT_NETHERLANDS_OOSTINDIEVAARDER_STRATEGY</Tag>
-		<English>This impressive naval unit (the Dutch replacement for the [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Galleon[COLOR_REVERT]) is the most powerful transport ship available until the introduction of the Transport. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD]: Now a [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Frigate[COLOR_REVERT] with cargo spaces instead of a warlike Galleon. Can no longer explore rival territory. The BtS unit was more efficient than Transport and thus often not worth upgrading, and, historically, East Indiamen were contemporary with frigates, not galleons, and were larger than frigates and at least as fast.</English>
-		<French>Cette impressionnante unit&#233; navale (unit&#233; n&#233;erlandaise qui remplace le [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]galion[COLOR_REVERT]) est le bateau de transport le plus puissant de ce jeu jusqu'&#224; l'invention du transport.</French>
-		<German>Diese beeindruckende Marineeinheit (die holl&#228;ndische Variante der [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Galeone[COLOR_REVERT]) repr&#228;sentiert das m&#228;chtigste Frachtschiff bis zur Entdeckung des Transportschiffs. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD]: Jetzt eine [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Fregatte[COLOR_REVERT] mit Frachtraum statt einer wehrhaften Galleone und kann kein gegnerisches Gebiet mehr erkunden. Bei der BtS-Einheit lohnte sich die Modernisierung zum weniger kosteneffizienten Transportschiff oft nicht, und historisch traten Ostindienfahrer deutlich sp�ter auf als Galleonen, als Zeitgenossen der Fregatten, waren aber eher noch gr��er und schneller.</German>
-		<Italian>Questa impressionante unit&#224; navale (il sostituto olandese del [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Galeone[COLOR_REVERT]) &#232; la pi&#249; potente nave da trasporto fino all'arrivo del Trasporto.</Italian>
-		<Spanish>Esta impresionante unidad naval (el sustituto holand&#233;s del [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Gale&#243;n[COLOR_REVERT]) es el barco de transporte m&#225;s poderoso que hay disponible hasta la introducci&#243;n del Transporte.</Spanish>
-	</TEXT>
 	<TEXT>
 		<Tag>TXT_KEY_UNIT_NETHERLANDS_OOSTINDIEVAARDER_PEDIA</Tag>
 		<English>[TAB]The term "East Indiaman" describes a vessel designed to transport goods between Europe, India, Indonesia and China during the eighteenth and nineteenth centuries. The East Indiaman was an armed merchantman; although primarily designed for the transport of goods and passengers, it was nevertheless outfitted with cannon in order to protect itself against pirates or to open up hostile ports of call. In fact, the East Indiamen were among the most heavily armed ships of their time, and were sometimes acquired by state navies for use as warships.[PARAGRAPH:1]Because the East Indiaman was designed to carry cannon, the East Indiaman was inevitably slower than its descendants: the Ship of the Line and the Frigate. Yet the strengths of the East Indiamen ensured that the European trade companies that employed them could protect their profitable monopolies on all trade between Europe, the Americas, Africa and India. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD]: I don't think the last paragraph is accurate: East Indiamen were often full-rigged clippers that could sustain speeds of 10 knots, whereas ships of the line sailed at perhaps 5 knots.</English>
@@ -486,147 +293,6 @@
 		<Italian>[TAB]Il nome "East Indiaman" indica un vascello progettato per trasportare beni tra Europa, India, Indonesia e Cina durante il diciottesimo e diciannovesimo secolo. L'East Indiaman era un mercantile armato; nonostante fosse progettato principalmente per il trasporto di merci e passeggeri, era dotato di cannoni per potersi proteggere dai pirati o per attaccare porti ostili. In verit&#224; l'East Indiaman era tra le navi pi&#249; pesantemente armate del proprio tempo, e alle volte fu acquistata dalle marine nazionali per essere usata come nave da guerra.[PARAGRAPH:1]Essendo l'East Indiaman progettata per essere armata con cannoni, era inevitabilmente pi&#249; lenta delle sue discendenti: la Nave da prima linea e la Fregata. Nonostante ci&#242;, i pregi dell'East Indiaman fecero in modo che le compagnie commerciali europee che la utilizzavano potessero proteggere i propri lucrosi monopoli sul commercio tra Europa, America, Africa e India.</Italian>
 		<Spanish>[TAB]El t&#233;rmino "nav&#237;o de las Indias Orientales" describe un barco dise&#241;ado para transportar mercanc&#237;as entre Europa, la India, Indonesia y China en los siglos XVIII y XIX. Se trataba de un mercante armado; aunque estaba dise&#241;ado principalmente como transporte de mercanc&#237;as y pasajeros, contaba con ca&#241;ones para protegerse de los piratas o entrar en los puertos hostiles. De hecho, estos nav&#237;os se contaban entre los barcos mejor armados de su &#233;poca y, en muchas ocasiones, fueron adquiridos por otros pa&#237;ses para emplearlos como barcos de guerra.[PARAGRAPH:1]Como estaba dise&#241;ado para llevar ca&#241;ones, el Nav&#237;o de las Indias Orientales era m&#225;s lento que sus sucesores: el Buque de guerra y la Fragata. Sin embargo, sus ventajas garantizaron que las compa&#241;&#237;as que los empleaban pudieran proteger sus lucrativos monopolios sobre el comercio entre Europa, las Am&#233;ricas, &#193;frica y la India.</Spanish>
 	</TEXT>
