-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>TXT_KEY_TECH_SAILING_STRATEGY</Tag>
-		<English>[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Sailing[COLOR_REVERT] allows you to build the [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Galley[COLOR_REVERT] unit. It also enables trading along coasts, and the construction of [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Lighthouses[COLOR_REVERT], of the [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Great Lighthouse[COLOR_REVERT] and the [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Moai Statues[COLOR_REVERT].
-		[BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD]: Trade along rivers no longer requires any technology. (This was also the case in Warlords; only Beyond the Sword had the Sailing requirement.)</English>
-		<French>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Navigation &#224; voile[COLOR_REVERT] vous permet de construire l'unit&#233; [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Gal&#232;re[COLOR_REVERT] et de faire du commerce le long des c&#244;tes et des cours d'eau. Elle permet aussi la construction du [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Phare[COLOR_REVERT] et des [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Statues Moa&#239;[COLOR_REVERT].</French>
-		<German>Das [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Segeln[COLOR_REVERT] erm&#246;glicht Ihnen den Bau einer [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Galeere[COLOR_REVERT], den Handel an K&#252;sten, sowie die Errichtung eines [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Leuchtturms[COLOR_REVERT] sowie der Wunder [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Gro&#223;er Luchtturm[COLOR_REVERT] und [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Moai Statuen[COLOR_REVERT]. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD]: F�r den Handel entlang Fl�ssen gibt es keine Technologievoraussetzung mehr. (Gab es in Warlords auch nicht; nur in Beyond the Sword war Segeln Voraussetzung.)</German>
-		<Italian>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Navigazione[COLOR_REVERT] permette la realizzazione di [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]galee[COLOR_REVERT]. Inoltre, premette gli scambi marittimi e fluviali e la costruzione del miglioramento cittadino [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Faro[COLOR_REVERT] e delle [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Statue Moai[COLOR_REVERT].</Italian>
-		<Spanish>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Navegaci&#243;n a vela[COLOR_REVERT] permite construir la unidad de la [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Galera[COLOR_REVERT]. Tambi&#233;n activa el comercio a lo largo de costas y r&#237;os, as&#237; como la construcci&#243;n de la mejora urbana del [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Faro[COLOR_REVERT] y la maravilla de [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Los Moai[COLOR_REVERT].</Spanish>
-	</TEXT>
-	
-	<!-- [advc.310] Obsoletes TGL now, not Colossus. -->
-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>TXT_KEY_TECH_ASTRONOMY_STRATEGY</Tag>
-		<English>[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Astronomy[COLOR_REVERT] allows access to the [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Galleon[COLOR_REVERT], as well as the [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Frigate[COLOR_REVERT] and the [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Privateer[COLOR_REVERT] (with [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Chemistry[COLOR_REVERT]) and the [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Ship of the Line[COLOR_REVERT] (with [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Military Science[COLOR_REVERT]). It enables trading on the ocean and lets you build [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Observatories[COLOR_REVERT]. It obsoletes [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Monuments[COLOR_REVERT] and the [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Great Lighthouse[COLOR_REVERT]. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD]: Astronomy used to obsolete the Colossus, and the Great Lighthouse used to go obsolete with Corporation, but the two extra trade routes were a bit too powerful combined with Astronomy's ocean trade ability. The Colossus is now obsolete with Chemistry.</English>
-		<French>L'[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Astronomie[COLOR_REVERT] permet de construire des [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Galions[COLOR_REVERT], des [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Fr&#233;gates[COLOR_REVERT], des [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Corsaires[COLOR_REVERT] (avec la [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Chimie[COLOR_REVERT]) et le [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Galion de guerre[COLOR_REVERT] (avec la [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Science militaire[COLOR_REVERT]). Elle d&#233;finit la carte du monde, permet de faire du commerce au-del&#224; des oc&#233;ans et de construire des [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Observatoires[COLOR_REVERT]. Elle rend obsol&#232;tes les b&#226;timents suivants : les merveilles [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Colosse[COLOR_REVERT] et [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Stonehenge[COLOR_REVERT] ainsi que le [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Monument[COLOR_REVERT].</French>
-		<German>Die [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Astronomie[COLOR_REVERT] erm&#246;glicht den Bau der [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Galeone[COLOR_REVERT], der [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Fregatte[COLOR_REVERT] und des [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Freibeuters[COLOR_REVERT] (mit [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Chemie[COLOR_REVERT]) sowie des [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Linienschiffs[COLOR_REVERT] (mit [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Milit&#228;rwissenschaft[COLOR_REVERT]). Der Handel auf dem Ozean wird m&#246;glich und Sie k&#246;nnen [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Observatorien[COLOR_REVERT] bauen. [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Monumente[COLOR_REVERT] und der [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Gro&#223;e Leuchtturm[COLOR_REVERT] werden veraltet. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD]: Urspr�nglich war mit Astronomie der Koloss veraltet, und der Leuchtturm erst mit Kapitalgesellschaft, aber die zwei Bonushandelsrouten waren zusammen mit dem Ozeanhandel von Astronomie zu spielstark. Der Koloss veraltet jetzt mit Chemie.</German>
-		<Italian>L'[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Astronomia[COLOR_REVERT] permette la produzione del [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]galeone[COLOR_REVERT], oltre che della [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]fregata[COLOR_REVERT] e della [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]nave corsara[COLOR_REVERT] (insieme con la [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Chimica[COLOR_REVERT]) e della [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]nave da prima linea[COLOR_REVERT] (insieme con la [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Scienza militare[COLOR_REVERT]). Essa inoltre permette gli scambi commerciali oltreoceano e la costruzione di [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]osservatori[COLOR_REVERT]. Rende obsolete le Meraviglie [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Colosso[COLOR_REVERT] e [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Stonehenge[COLOR_REVERT] e il [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Monumento[COLOR_REVERT].</Italian>
-		<Spanish>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Astronom&#237;a[COLOR_REVERT] permite el [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Gale&#243;n[COLOR_REVERT], as&#237; como la [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Fragata[COLOR_REVERT] y el [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Corsario[COLOR_REVERT] (junto con la [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Qu&#237;mica[COLOR_REVERT]) y el [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Buque de guerra[COLOR_REVERT] (junto con la [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Belicolog&#237;a[COLOR_REVERT]). Tambi&#233;n activa el intercambio transoce&#225;nico y permite construir [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Observatorios[COLOR_REVERT]. Tambi&#233;n deja obsoletas las maravillas del [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Coloso[COLOR_REVERT] y de [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Stonehenge[COLOR_REVERT], as&#237; como el edificio del [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Monumento[COLOR_REVERT].</Spanish>
-	</TEXT>
-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>TXT_KEY_TECH_CHEMISTRY_STRATEGY</Tag>
-		<English>[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Chemistry[COLOR_REVERT] allows construction of [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Privateers[COLOR_REVERT] and [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Frigates[COLOR_REVERT] (with [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Astronomy[COLOR_REVERT]). It increases production from all workshops by 1, and obsoletes the [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Colossus[COLOR_REVERT]. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD]: The Colossus used to go obsolete with Astronomy; that tech now obsoletes the Great Lighthouse.</English>
-		<French>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Chimie[COLOR_REVERT] permet la construction de [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Corsaires[COLOR_REVERT] et de [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Fr&#233;gates[COLOR_REVERT] (avec l'[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]astronomie[COLOR_REVERT]). Elle augmente aussi de + 1 la production de tous les ateliers.</French>
-		<German>Die [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Chemie[COLOR_REVERT] erm&#246;glicht den Bau von [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Freibeutern[COLOR_REVERT] und [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Fregatten[COLOR_REVERT] (mit [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Astronomie[COLOR_REVERT]). Sie erh&#246;ht die Produktion aller Werkst&#228;tten um 1 und macht den [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Koloss[COLOR_REVERT] veraltet. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD]: Der Koloss wurde urspr�nglich durch Astronomie veraltet; stattdessen veraltet Astronomie jetzt den Gro�en Leuchtturm.</German>
-		<Italian>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Chimica[COLOR_REVERT] permette la realizzazione di [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]navi corsare[COLOR_REVERT] e [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]fregate[COLOR_REVERT] (insieme all'[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Astronomia[COLOR_REVERT]). Inoltre aumenta la produzione di tutte le botteghe di 1.</Italian>
-		<Spanish>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Qu&#237;mica[COLOR_REVERT] permite la creaci&#243;n de [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Corsarios[COLOR_REVERT] y [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Fragatas[COLOR_REVERT] (junto con la [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Astronom&#237;a[COLOR_REVERT]). Tambi&#233;n aumenta en 1 la producci&#243;n de todos los talleres.</Spanish>
-	</TEXT>
