-		<English>[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Biology[COLOR_REVERT] allows your workers to [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]preserve Forests[COLOR_REVERT], and to build [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Farms[COLOR_REVERT] without [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Irrigation[COLOR_REVERT]. It increases the food production of all [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Farms[COLOR_REVERT] by 1. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD]: To avoid giving more than six abilities to Scientific Method, Forest Preserve has been moved to Biology.</English>
-		<French>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]biologie[COLOR_REVERT] permet &#224; vos ouvriers de construire des [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]fermes[COLOR_REVERT] sans [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]irrigation[COLOR_REVERT]. Elle augmente de + 1 la production de nourriture de toutes les [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]fermes[COLOR_REVERT].</French>
-		<German>Die [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Biologie[COLOR_REVERT] erm&#246;glicht es Bautrupps, in W&#228;ldern [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Aufforstungsgebiete[COLOR_REVERT] einzurichten, und ohne Bew&#228;sserung [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Bauernh&#246;fe[COLOR_REVERT] zu bauen. Dar&#252;ber hinaus erh&#246;ht sie die Nahrungsmittelproduktion aller [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Bauernh&#246;fe[COLOR_REVERT] um 1. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD]: Um Wiss. Methode nicht mehr als sechs F�higkeiten zu geben, erfordert Aufforstungsgebiet jetzt stattdessen Biologie.</German>
-		<Italian>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Biologia[COLOR_REVERT] permette ai lavoratori di costruire le [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]fattorie[COLOR_REVERT] senza [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]irrigazione[COLOR_REVERT]. Aumenta la produzione di cibo di tutte le [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]fattorie[COLOR_REVERT] di 1.</Italian>
-		<Spanish>La [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Biolog&#237;a[COLOR_REVERT] permite a los trabajadores construir [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Granjas[COLOR_REVERT] sin [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Riego[COLOR_REVERT]. Adem&#225;s, aumenta en 1 la producci&#243;n de alimentos de todas las [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Granjas[COLOR_REVERT]. </Spanish>
