-		<English>[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Monarchy[COLOR_REVERT] allows the [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Hereditary Rule[COLOR_REVERT] civic. It also enables [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Wineries[COLOR_REVERT]. </English>
