-		<English>[COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Nationalism[COLOR_REVERT] enables the [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Nationhood[COLOR_REVERT] civic as well as construction of the [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Taj Mahal[COLOR_REVERT] world wonder and the culturally-powerful [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Hermitage[COLOR_REVERT] national wonder. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD]: Also removes "we fear for our safety" [ICON_UNHAPPY] from undefended cities - so that human players don't keep token garrisons of Warriors and Archers in their cities forever just to avoid unhappiness.</English>
-		<French>Le [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]nationalisme[COLOR_REVERT] permet d'instaurer une doctrine de [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]nation[COLOR_REVERT] et de construire le [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Taj Mahal[COLOR_REVERT] et l'[COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Ermitage[COLOR_REVERT] tr&#232;s propice &#224; la culture.</French>
-		<German>Der [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Nationalismus[COLOR_REVERT] ist die Voraussetzung f&#252;r die [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]nationale Selbstst&#228;ndigkeit[COLOR_REVERT]. Er erm&#246;glicht den Bau eines Weltwunders ([COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Taj Mahal[COLOR_REVERT]) und eines bedeutenden Nationalen Wunders ([COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Eremitage[COLOR_REVERT]). [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD]: Entfernt au�erdem Unzufriedenheit ([ICON_UNHAPPY]) �ber fehlenden milit�rischen Schutz - damit Spieler nicht l�ngst veraltete Einheiten als Pro-Forma-Garnisonen einsetzen.</German>
-		<Italian>Il [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Nazionalismo[COLOR_REVERT] permette la realizzazione della forma di governo [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Identit&#224; nazionale[COLOR_REVERT], oltre alla costruzione della Grande Meraviglia [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Taj Mahal[COLOR_REVERT] e la Meraviglia Nazionale [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Hermitage[COLOR_REVERT].</Italian>
-		<Spanish>El [COLOR_TECH_TEXT]Nacionalismo[COLOR_REVERT] activa el principio de [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Patria[COLOR_REVERT], la construcci&#243;n de la maravilla mundial del [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Taj Mahal[COLOR_REVERT] y de la maravilla nacional del [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Hermitage[COLOR_REVERT], tan poderosa para la cultura.</Spanish>
-	</TEXT>
