-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>TXT_KEY_BUILDING_THEATRE_STRATEGY</Tag>
-		<English>A [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Theatre[COLOR_REVERT] increases a city's culture and increases the happiness output from using the culture slider. A [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Theatre[COLOR_REVERT] also provides culture and is required to build the [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Globe Theatre[COLOR_REVERT] national wonder. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] decreases the impact of Theatre on happiness from the culture slider (and instead increases the impact of Colosseum).</English>
-		<French>Un [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]th&#233;&#226;tre[COLOR_REVERT] am&#233;liore la culture d'une ville et accro&#238;t son bonheur gr&#226;ce au curseur de culture. Un [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]th&#233;&#226;tre[COLOR_REVERT] g&#233;n&#232;re aussi de la culture et est n&#233;cessaire pour construire le [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Th&#233;&#226;tre du Globe[COLOR_REVERT].</French>
