-	<TEXT>
-		<Tag>TXT_KEY_BUILDING_AQUEDUCT_STRATEGY</Tag>
-		<English>The [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Aqueduct[COLOR_REVERT] improves a city's health and is required to build the [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Hanging Gardens[COLOR_REVERT] wonder. Build [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Aqueducts[COLOR_REVERT] when you want to grow a city, or when the populace begins clamoring for it. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] slightly reduces the [ICON_PRODUCTION] cost of this building.</English>
