-		<English>The [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Panzer[COLOR_REVERT] is the German replacement for the [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Tank[COLOR_REVERT] and gets a bonus when fighting other tanks. [BOLD]AdvCiv[\BOLD] adds two first strikes to this unit (replacing the 1-2 first strikes plus free [LINK=PROMOTION_FLANKING1]Flanking I[\LINK] promotion that K-Mod had added).</English>
