-		<English>The [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Sistine Chapel[COLOR_REVERT] causes each specialist in every city to generate culture. The [COLOR_BUILDING_TEXT]Sistine Chapel[COLOR_REVERT] has a very high cultural value, and it increases its city's odds of generating a [COLOR_UNIT_TEXT]Great Artist[COLOR_REVERT]. [BOLD]K-Mod[\BOLD] has reduced the [ICON_CULTURE] rate that gets added to religious buildings (was +5 in BtS) and, unlike other building [ICON_CULTURE] rates, the added [ICON_CULTURE] rate doesn't double after 1000 years.</English>
